@startuml 26-robot-certificates
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title Robots: a short, restricted certificate per run
autonumber "<b>0."
participant "CI job\n(acme-deploy)" as job
participant "Trusted signing service\n(holds the fleet token)" as svc
participant "PKI Manager\n/api/v1/external/ssh/sign-user" as pki
participant "acme-web\n(sshd)" as web
job -> svc : I am job acme-deploy (CI identity)
svc -> svc : check the job, pick ITS principal
svc -> pki : sign-user · principals [acme-deployer]\nvalidForSeconds 900 · extensions []\nforceCommand /usr/local/bin/deploy
pki --> svc : certificate (15 min)
svc --> job : certificate only (token never leaves the service)
job -> web : ssh deploy@acme-web
web -> web : deploy file has acme-deployer -> match\nforced command runs, no pty, no forwarding
note over svc, pki : A sign-user token can sign ANY principal in its zone:\nkeep it out of CI jobs.
@enduml
